Cell["\<\
This time we generate the list in steps so we can figure out how long \
simulation needs to take.  We initially stop trajectories when they reach 300 \
dividing cells so we can see how it\[CloseCurlyQuote]s working.  Then we \
continue them on.  \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.947084947638077*^9, 3.947085011519252*^9}, {
  3.95186641475334*^9, 
  3.951866460833598*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"75230c30-c199-400f-b47b-\
e10c918c807b"],

